{"title":"马斯克抛出“百万倍市值”设想 SpaceX与特斯拉合并提速","link":"https://linux.do/t/topic/3263576","date":1795859999000,"content":"<p></p><div><a href=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/4/0/0/400296f393d6fb7b6da6d8e0d0bc9e3478b11401.png\"><img src=\"/media/09575335109cca690ef69e903a95d25994b8573690d5b80ea6ac6239c83e1cf1.png\" alt=\"image\" width=\"690\" height=\"105\" srcset=\"/media/09575335109cca690ef69e903a95d25994b8573690d5b80ea6ac6239c83e1cf1.png, /media/8983f44ae84eeae4c07bbdffb7495881610c346c1fcc9729f7ea8e82d2288a75.png 1.5x, /media/ad0dff00271686fac3be63c57cdfea2b289328663b844a7421c9f1f63be78677.png 2x\" /></a></div><p></p><aside>\n  <header>\n      <img src=\"https://finance.eastmoney.com/favicon.ico\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />\n\n      <a href=\"https://finance.eastmoney.com/a/202611283942378384.html\" target=\"_blank\">finance.eastmoney.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article>\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://finance.eastmoney.com/a/202611283942378384.html\" target=\"_blank\">马斯克抛出“百万倍市值”设想 SpaceX与特斯拉合并提速 _ 东方财富网</a></h3>\n\n  <p>【马斯克抛出“百万倍市值”设想 SpaceX与特斯拉合并提速】美国太空探索技术公司SpaceX负责人马斯克11月26日在社交媒体发文：在满足一定条件的前提下，SpaceX未来市值可能达到当前全球经济规模的约100万倍。他同时呼吁投资者持有SpaceX股票。</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div>\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div></div>\n</aside>\n\n            <p><small>1 post - 1 participant</small></p>\n            <p><a href=\"https://linux.do/t/topic/3263576\">Read full topic</a></p>","author":"𝓵𝓮𝔃𝓲𝓼𝓱𝓮𝓷","siteTitle":"LINUX DO","siteHash":"5808128e5c08c220203e95e862702138b99fd39109d6744dab50af50935039c4","entryHash":"4a61577656f2da5216decfb9676a1cd5d28607cf0ff356ccdd2f68e3066a7927","category":"IT 科技"}